WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.279
Mutation status.

2
00:00:01.279 --> 00:00:04.582
See which stage your mutation application has reached.

3
00:00:04.582 --> 00:00:06.846
You only need the application number.

4
00:00:07.801 --> 00:00:08.311
Step 1.

5
00:00:08.311 --> 00:00:09.914
Open the mutation tab.

6
00:00:09.914 --> 00:00:13.702
On the home page search card, press Mutation status.

7
00:00:13.702 --> 00:00:16.471
The page is also in the Services menu.

8
00:00:17.424 --> 00:00:18.020
Step 2.

9
00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:20.490
Enter the application number.

10
00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:26.453
Type the mutation number from your receipt, for example MUT-2023-0007.

11
00:00:26.453 --> 00:00:28.497
Then press Track status.

12
00:00:29.454 --> 00:00:30.015
Step 3.

13
00:00:30.015 --> 00:00:31.457
Follow the stages.

14
00:00:31.457 --> 00:00:36.184
You see four stages: applied, review, hearing and decision.

15
00:00:36.184 --> 00:00:39.308
Finished stages have a tick and a date.
